{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ABOUT THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the near-futuristic dystopia that is Vacancy City. In an open-world, action-RPG featuring a combination of elements from Western and Japanese RPGs. Join the ragtag squad of unlikely allies led by the war veteran-turned-mercenary Fawke Harvey as they apprehend crime while they uncover a conspiracy which threatens the whole city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT AS A TEAM<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/62c76bbdcbafe8a3272e26c2a9c9e06c.poster.avif?t=1761978699\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/62c76bbdcbafe8a3272e26c2a9c9e06c.webm?t=1761978699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/62c76bbdcbafe8a3272e26c2a9c9e06c.mp4?t=1761978699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a squad with 8 playable characters ranging from a high-tech infiltrator to a Chinese martial artist who impersonates the mythological character Sun Wukong in action packed combat on the dangerous streets of Vacancy City.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENJOY THE CITYLIFE<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/3afddc3dfbca33d84016b7fc1d542cbb.poster.avif?t=1761978699\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/3afddc3dfbca33d84016b7fc1d542cbb.webm?t=1761978699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/3afddc3dfbca33d84016b7fc1d542cbb.mp4?t=1761978699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of Vacancy City filled with many city districts from the Asian influenced Little Asia to the art-deco inspired Luxe, enjoy what each district has to offer being eateries, shops, and entertainment but do be careful who you may encounter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONNECT WITH OTHERS<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/d37f5872bcdb33b6f3188dd8da12c098.poster.avif?t=1761978699\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/d37f5872bcdb33b6f3188dd8da12c098.webm?t=1761978699\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/extras/d37f5872bcdb33b6f3188dd8da12c098.mp4?t=1761978699\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vacancy City is filled with colourful, larger-than-life characters waiting to be interacted with. Create relationships with them by communicating them via dialogue or private messages, and experience the many stories they have to tell.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1910910?t=1761978699","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1910910?t=1761978699","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/fed27eb70e4c4297fd912a4cee2c449bb039540a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761978699","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1910910/fed27eb70e4c4297fd912a4cee2c449bb039540a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761978699","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support"